      "role": "Judged by responsibilities, not title. A posting outside the seven curated roles (software engineering, consulting, management) is 'other'.",
      "seniority": "'staff' maps to principal; a posting that never signals a level is 'unclear'.",
      "years_experience_min": "The smallest number of years demanded; null when the posting gives none.",
      "skills": "Every technology, tool, platform and named technical practice, whether required or preferred. Generic words ('communication', 'teamwork') are left out."
    }
